<title>USA: U.S. Nov factory orders fell 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Nov factory orders fell 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce seasonally adjusted</p>
<p>data on U.S. factory orders, shipments and unfilled orders.</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Nov--(Prev)	Oct--(Prev)    Sept</p>
<p> New Orders		 -0.4		  1.1    0.9	2.6</p>
<p> -Ex-Transportation     -0.7		  2.3    2.3	0.3</p>
<p> -Ex-Defense		-1.5		  1.0    1.0	2.5</p>
<p> NonDurables		 0.8		  1.6    1.5	0.3</p>
<p> Durables		   -1.5   -1.6	 0.6    0.5	4.5</p>
<p> NonDefense Cap	   -7.5   -7.8	-0.1   -0.4     15.4</p>
<p> -Ex-Aircraft, Parts    -1.9   -1.6	 2.0    1.6	2.2</p>
<p> -Defense Cap	     60.5   55.2	 2.3    2.0	7.1</p>
<p>    ORDERS-PCT CHANGES:  Nov--(Prev)	Oct--(Prev)    Sept</p>
