<p>  Transport Equip.     42.07   41.58    41.60   41.60    44.64</p>
<p>Wall Street economists had expected a 0.6 percent drop in total factory orders for November.</p>
<p>The November inventories-to-shipments ratio was 1.38, down from 1.39 in October.</p>
<p>The department said the 9.1 percent drop in electronic and other electrical equipment was the largest decrease in new orders for durable goods in November, due to a drop in orders for electronic components and communications equipment. It followed a 17.2 percent rise in October.</p>
<p>The department reported initial data on November orders for durable goods on December 27.</p>
